### ===================================================================
### SMART SHROOM SCM — LIVE API DEMONSTRATION & TEST SUITE
### Sistem Informasi Supply Chain Management & Spasial WMS Kumbung Jamur
### Standar: VS Code REST Client (Huachao Mao) / Thunder Client
### ===================================================================

@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8000/api
@adminEmail = admin@smartshroom.test
@adminPassword = password123

### ===================================================================
### MODUL 0: AUTENTIKASI & KEAMANAN (SANCTUM RBAC)
### ===================================================================

### 0.1 Login Akun Admin (Mendapatkan Token Sanctum)
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/login HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "email": "{{adminEmail}}",
  "password": "{{adminPassword}}"
}

### Tangkap Token Sanctum Otomatis untuk Request Berikutnya
@authToken = {{login.response.body.token}}

### 0.2 Verifikasi Proteksi RBAC: Akses SCM Tanpa Token (Harus 401 Unauthorized)
GET {{baseUrl}}/suppliers HTTP/1.1
Accept: application/json

### 0.3 Profil User Terautentikasi
GET {{baseUrl}}/user HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json


### ===================================================================
### MODUL 1: SCM HULU (SUPPLIER SCORECARD & CACAT KEDATANGAN)
### ===================================================================

### 1.1 Daftar Master Pemasok Bibit Aktif
GET {{baseUrl}}/suppliers?active_only=true HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 1.2 Pendaftaran Rekanan Pemasok Baru
POST {{baseUrl}}/suppliers HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "name": "CV Jamur Sejahtera Sleman",
  "contact_person": "Haji Slamet",
  "phone": "081298765432",
  "address": "Jl. Kaliurang KM 14, Sleman, D.I. Yogyakarta",
  "lead_time_days": 5,
  "is_active": true
}

### 1.3 Matriks Komparasi Kinerja Seluruh Pemasok (Supplier Scorecard Matrix)
### Bobot: Defect Kedatangan 35%, Mortalitas 25%, Produktivitas 25%, HPP 15%
### Output: Ranking dan Grading Kualitas Mutu Pemasok (Grade A, B, C, D)
GET {{baseUrl}}/suppliers/comparison HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 1.4 Detail Audit Scorecard Individual Pemasok ID 1
GET {{baseUrl}}/suppliers/1/scorecard HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 1.5 Input Pengadaan Batch Baru dengan Cacat Kedatangan (Isolasi Cacat Tiba)
### Qty awal 500, cacat tiba 15 -> Otomatis masuk cull CACAT_KEDATANGAN & kuota rak = 485
POST {{baseUrl}}/baglogs HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "supplier_id": 1,
  "entry_date": "2026-10-31",
  "initial_quantity": 500,
  "price_per_baglog": 2800,
  "rejected_at_arrival": 15,
  "notes": "Pengadaan bibit batch uji coba demo sidang - 15 bibit cacat dipisahkan saat tiba"
}


### ===================================================================
### MODUL 2: SCM TENGAH (KAPASITAS SPASIAL & SMART RESTOCK ADVISOR)
### ===================================================================

### 2.1 Snapshot Kapasitas Fisik Kumbung Real-Time (Maks. 3.000 Baglog)
### Memantau slot rak terisi vs kosong dan baglog aktif di dalam kumbung
GET {{baseUrl}}/scm/capacity-snapshot HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 2.2 Proyeksi Kapasitas Bergulir (Rolling Capacity Forecast 7-30 Hari)
### Menghitung proyeksi slot bebas pada horizon 7, 14, 21, dan 30 hari ke depan
GET {{baseUrl}}/scm/capacity-forecast HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 2.3 Rekomendasi Restock / Purchase Order Cerdas (DSS Advisor)
### Menghitung: Tanggal Order Optimal, Kuantitas Rekomendasi (Anti Overload), dan Supplier Prioritas
GET {{baseUrl}}/scm/restock-recommendations HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json


### ===================================================================
### MODUL 3: SCM HILIR (SEGMENTASI PEMBELI & TRACEABILITY DUA ARAH)
### ===================================================================

### 3.1 Daftar Master Pelanggan Jamur (Filter Segmen: RESTO)
GET {{baseUrl}}/customers?category=RESTO HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 3.2 Registrasi Pelanggan Baru
POST {{baseUrl}}/customers HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "name": "Warung Jamur Crispy Pak Kumis",
  "category": "RESTO",
  "phone": "081345678901",
  "address": "Jl. Magelang KM 8, Mlati, Sleman",
  "is_active": true
}

### 3.3 Analisis Segmentasi Pasar Pelanggan (Market Analytics)
### Mengelompokkan serapan volume panen (kg) dan kontribusi omzet per kategori pembeli
GET {{baseUrl}}/customers/analytics HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 3.4 Ketertelusuran Maju: Batch ke Pelanggan (Forward Traceability)
### Lacak: Pemasok Asal -> Tanggal Masuk -> Kamar Rak Spasial A/B/C -> Panen -> Pelanggan Pembeli
GET {{baseUrl}}/scm/traceability/batch/BL-20261002-001 HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 3.5 Ketertelusuran Mundur: Nota Penjualan ke Pemasok Bibit (Backward Traceability)
### Lacak: ID Penjualan -> Batch Sumber -> Pemasok Rekanan Penyedia Bibit Jamur
GET {{baseUrl}}/scm/traceability/sale/1 HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

